# Pairs with EventualConvergence in ReplicationReBootstrap. An export opened
# while detached cannot settle reattachment: the shipper re-marks the required
# export epoch when it reattaches (#4533). Omitting the owed successor restores
# the model gap found by the matching-bound control in #5116.
MODULE: EventualConvergenceDetachedExportSettlesReattach
TARGET: EventualConvergence
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: an export opened while detached settles reattachment without the fresh export its new epoch requires
PERTURBS: EndExport
BOUNDS: Third = TRUE, Reattach = FALSE, MaxHlc = 2

--- FIND
                    \/ detached
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the export opened while detached is treated as the final re-seed.
--- END
